<view class="page"><view class="eyebrow">CONTENT STUDIO</view><view class="h1">城市内容工作台</view><block wx:if="{{!logged}}"><view class="panel"><view class="title">内容管理员登录</view><view class="notice">本地初始密码保存在项目 data/admin-password.txt 中。请勿分享密码。</view><input class="field" password placeholder="管理员密码" value="{{password}}" data-field="password" bindinput="input"/><button class="primary" loading="{{busy}}" bindtap="login">进入内容工作台</button></view></block><block wx:else><scroll-view scroll-x class="chips"><view wx:for="{{tabs}}" wx:key="id" class="chip {{tab===item.id?'active':''}}" data-id="{{item.id}}" bindtap="tab">{{item.name}}</view></scroll-view><view wx:if="{{tab==='overview'}}"><view class="grid"><view wx:for="{{metrics}}" wx:key="type" class="card"><view class="number">{{item.count}}</view><view class="meta">{{item.label}}</view></view></view><view class="notice">待审 {{overview.pending}} 条 · 到期 {{overview.expired}} 条 · 近期缺口 {{overview.gaps.length}} 条</view><view class="h2">内容覆盖</view><view class="grid"><view wx:for="{{overview.coverage}}" wx:key="id" class="card"><view class="title">{{item.name}}</view><view class="meta">{{item.articles}} 篇资料 · {{item.places}} 个地点</view></view></view><view class="h2">需要补充的问题</view><view wx:for="{{overview.gaps}}" wx:key="index" class="card">{{item.question}}</view></view><block wx:if="{{tab==='articles'||tab==='places'||tab==='events'||tab==='sources'}}"><button class="primary" bindtap="create">新增记录 ＋</button><view wx:if="{{editor}}" class="panel"><view class="title">编辑 {{selected}}</view><view class="notice">请核验后发布。活动需要真实日期和核验日期。归档后从公众列表退出。</view><textarea class="json-editor" value="{{editor}}" data-field="editor" bindinput="input" maxlength="40000"/><picker wx:if="{{tab!=='sources'}}" range="{{statuses}}" value="{{statusIndex}}" bindchange="status"><view class="field">状态：{{statuses[statusIndex]}} ▾</view></picker><button class="primary" loading="{{busy}}" bindtap="save">保存修改</button></view><view wx:for="{{records}}" wx:key="id" class="card"><view data-id="{{item.id}}" bindtap="edit"><view class="title">{{item.title||item.name}} ↗</view><view class="meta">{{item.id}} · {{item.status}} · 版本 {{item.revision||0}}</view><view wx:if="{{item.lastFetchError}}" class="warning">{{item.lastFetchError}}</view></view><button wx:if="{{tab==='sources'}}" class="link" data-id="{{item.id}}" bindtap="check">检查来源变化</button><button wx:if="{{tab==='sources'}}" class="link" data-id="{{item.id}}" bindtap="collect">采集页面元数据为草稿</button></view></block><view wx:if="{{tab==='feedback'}}"><view wx:for="{{records}}" wx:key="id" class="panel"><view class="meta">{{item.target}} · {{item.type}} · {{item.status}}</view><view class="body">{{item.message}}</view><button class="secondary" data-id="{{item.id}}" data-status="{{item.status}}" bindtap="resolve">{{item.status==='resolved'?'重新打开':'标记已处理'}}</button></view></view><view wx:if="{{tab==='audit'}}"><view wx:for="{{records}}" wx:key="id" class="panel"><view class="title">{{item.action}} · {{item.kind}}</view><view class="meta">{{item.record_id}} · {{item.created_at}}</view><view class="body" selectable>{{item.formatted}}</view></view></view><view wx:if="{{tab==='import'}}" class="panel"><view class="title">公开资料整理为草稿</view><view class="notice">配置大模型后提取分类与摘要，未配置时形成原文片段草稿。结果不自动发布，必须核验。</view><input class="field" placeholder="草稿标题" value="{{draftTitle}}" data-field="draftTitle" bindinput="input" maxlength="120"/><picker range="{{sourceOptions}}" value="{{sourceIndex}}" bindchange="sourcePick"><view class="field">{{sourceOptions[sourceIndex]}} ▾</view></picker><textarea class="json-editor" placeholder="粘贴30—20000字公开资料，请勿提交敏感内容" value="{{rawContent}}" data-field="rawContent" bindinput="input" maxlength="20000"/><button class="primary" loading="{{busy}}" bindtap="organize">整理并保存待审草稿</button><view class="divider"/><view class="title">批量导入 JSON</view><view class="notice">填写同类型数组，全部校验通过后一次性写入。完整城市文件请先按来源、资料、地点、活动的顺序分批导入。</view><picker range="{{importKinds}}" value="{{importIndex}}" bindchange="kind"><view class="field">类型：{{importKinds[importIndex]}} ▾</view></picker><textarea class="json-editor" value="{{batch}}" placeholder="[{ ... }]" data-field="batch" bindinput="input" maxlength="300000"/><button class="primary" loading="{{busy}}" disabled="{{!batch}}" bindtap="import">校验并导入</button></view><view class="divider"/><button class="secondary" bindtap="export">导出城市资料</button><button class="link" bindtap="logout">退出管理</button></block></view>
